{"In Lithuanian locale files (account and login), the totpStep1/loginTotpStep1 key is replaced with Italian text ('Installa una delle seguenti applicazioni sul tuo cellulare:') instead of Lithuanian, causing Lithuanian users to see Italian instructions for TOTP setup": 0.9986270666122437, "The totpStep1 replacement in messages_zh_CN.properties (Simplified Chinese locale) uses Traditional Chinese characters (\u624b\u6a5f, \u5b89\u88dd, \u61c9\u7528\u7a0b\u5f0f) instead of the required Simplified Chinese (\u624b\u673a, \u5b89\u88c5, \u5e94\u7528\u7a0b\u5e8f), making it inconsistent with the rest of the file and incorrect for the zh_CN locale": 0.9899044632911682, "In account-ui, error-invalid-multivalued-size was changed from i18next-style {{0}} placeholders to MessageFormat/ICU-style {0} + {2,choice,...}, but account-ui uses plain i18next interpolation, so this string will render with raw {0}/{2,choice,...} instead of substituted values": 0.9424273371696472}